  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Indeed. They don't know that Faust is following them. I received some information from one of his scouts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is trapped around the perimeter of the city center."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Insects as they might be, they still might take advantage of the confusion caused by the Catastrophe to make their escape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Given their understanding of the situation in Chernobog, they could potentially interfere with our plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "... At least, getting rid of them won't do us any harm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Chernobog bastards! It's because of you, it's all your fault... that us Infected became like this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Get lost!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "These people, it's like they're just waiting to die! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Why is Reunion going completely berserk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Why are they sending so many members out here now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "This makes no sense! There's no reason for them to be defending this place so staunchly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Operators, stand your ground! Push Reunion back and open up an escape route!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "So that's the 'Rhodes Island' that I've been hearing so much about? Heh... How heroic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "... Falling rocks? At a time like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Don't stop moving! Maintain our defensive line!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Something's not right... These rocks are coming from the buildings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "What are you talking about..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "It's here! It's here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ahaha... salvation has come for us! Judgment day has come!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "They were... crushed by something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Was it one of you... who attacked them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Or were they..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann! Look, the sky...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "The sky was dyed a bloody crimson..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "'Boiling dark clouds, tumbling in flames...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Don't panic!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Keep your senses about you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "... We still can make it out of this alive if we act decisively!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "'...As terror strips away their voices, the land falls into silence.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "'The titanic Originium lowers its head...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "'...and falls upon the scorched shadow of death.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Talulah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "What do we do next?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "... Perhaps they will be able to survive the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Finish off the stragglers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Very well."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Even though I figured that Reunion would be using the Catastrophe to take their revenge..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I didn't expect them to use it to completely destroy Chernobog..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Rather than vengeance, this seems more like a manifesto..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Something about the Era of the Infected... or something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Aaaahh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "The entire sky... is crashing down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Watch out! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "What's that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Be more alert!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "-- Oh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Protect the Medic - hurry and take her someplace safe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "All operators, find cover!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "All teams, prepare to... weather the Catastrophe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
